  "content": "<h1><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>遺留主機版教學世界合集</strong></span></h1><h1><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我整理了一個合集，收錄了所有</span><a style=\"font-size:14px;background-color:#ffffff\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fLegacy_Console_Edition\" rel=\"nofollow\">遺留主機版</a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">的教學世界。包含從TU1到TU69的所有教學世界，以及小遊戲大廳：</span></h1><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu1\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU1</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu3\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU3</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu5\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU5</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu7\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU7</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu9\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU9</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu12\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU12</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu14\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU14</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu19\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU19</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu31\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU31</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu46\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU46</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252ftutorial-worlds%252ftu69\" rel=\"nofollow\">TU69</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252fmini-game-maps%252f2016-mini-game-lobby\" rel=\"nofollow\">2016 小遊戲大廳</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252fmini-game-maps%252f2017-mini-game-lobby\" rel=\"nofollow\">2017 小遊戲大廳</a></span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">這些教學世界可以更新到最新版本的Java版，另外還有基岩版也同樣可以更新到最新版本。</span></p><p><strong style=\"font-size:18px\">特別感謝：</strong></p><div>&nbsp;</div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.theminecraftarchitect.com%252fcredits\" rel=\"nofollow\">由 Minecraft 建築師轉換並更新</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><em>這些世界年代久遠，並已被移植到另一個版本，因此可能含有錯誤且不穩定。</em></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
